# Scratch CSVs in the repo root: templates from `npm run template`, and the
# one-off payloads fed to `npm run append` / `npm run edit`. The sheet is the
# source of truth and src/data/*.fallback.json is the committed snapshot, so
# these are transient by definition.
/*.csv
.DS_Store

# public/tech/ is intentionally NOT ignored. The icons are ~1.5KB SVGs downloaded by
# `npm run data`; committing them keeps the build reproducible offline and means a
# CDN outage can't strip the stack section of its icons.

# Claude Code local config and skills - not part of the project
.claude/
